  "oficiu": {
    "_comment": "Din oficiu (Feature 95769, US-242…249, js/ghiseu.js mode „oficiu”): the post-processes the authority starts on its own initiative. postprocese = the stand-in for Setări › „Postprocese pe acte permisive” › „Statute din care se inițiază” for the ex-officio request types (US-221, not in the passport yet): service code → act status → the request types offered in the act's ⋮ (AC-07/08; a status without types = no ⋮, AC-09). termene = the examination term after submission, in working days (js/working-days.js). docs = the predefined documents of an ex-officio dossier (US-20). drafts = the seeded drafts of «Dosare inițiate din oficiu» (act = an act id of `acts`; step = STEP_INDEX: 2 Date titular · 3 Detalii serviciu · 4 Acte necesare · 5 Verificare · 6 Livrare; dates as day offsets from today; by self = the signed-in user, anyone else is not listed, US-249 AC-04; ofc-4702 = past its retention, removed automatically by SIA GEAP at load, US-247 AC-08).",
